# plex skill — PERSONAL.md

Local to this machine only. Copy to `~/.claude/skills/plex/PERSONAL.md` and fill in. Never committed to the `plexctl` repo (gitignored). Rules here override SKILL.md defaults.

## Required

- **Up Next Tonight playlist ratingKey:** `<RATING_KEY>` — from `plexctl playlist list`. If the playlist does not exist yet, `plexctl playlist create "Up Next Tonight" <KEY>` and record the key here.

## Evening planning (optional — SKILL.md defaults apply when unset)

- **Evening start time:** 6:00 pm — anchor for the `Starts` column.
- **Target evening length:** ~3h — suggestions aim here; mention once when a list runs well past it.
- **Slot habits:** e.g. "Show X usually opens the night", "films after 8 pm".
- **Rotation staples:** shows that belong in most nights' suggestions.
- **Movie-night shape:** e.g. "double feature, older film first".

## Other local rules (optional)

- Rating destination (Plex only, Trakt via scrobbler, etc.).
- Per-show language defaults (e.g. "Dark → deu").
